{"date":"2026-11-23","sentence":{"cantonese":"早晨！好耐冇見，你最近點呀？","jyutping":"zou2 san4! hou2 noi6 mou5 gin3, nei5 zeoi3 gan6 dim2 aa3?","mandarin":"早上好！好久不见，你最近怎么样？"},"theme":"问候与礼貌","tip":"粵語第二聲係升調（35 調），要往上挑，好似問嘢噉——「早 zou2」「好 hou2」唔好讀成客家話嘅平調，開口就先練「挑上去」。","weekday":"周一","words":[{"cantonese":"早晨","hakka":"zau sen","jyutping":"zou2 san4","mandarin":"早上好"},{"cantonese":"唔該晒","hakka":"m goi sai","jyutping":"m4 goi1 saai3","mandarin":"非常感谢"},{"cantonese":"好耐冇見","hakka":"hau noi mau gien","jyutping":"hou2 noi6 mou5 gin3","mandarin":"好久不见"},{"cantonese":"食咗飯未","hakka":"sit zo fan mui","jyutping":"sik6 zo2 faan6 mei6","mandarin":"吃饭了吗（打招呼）"},{"cantonese":"唔好客氣","hakka":"m hau hak hi","jyutping":"m4 hou2 haak3 hei3","mandarin":"不客气"}]}